// Title: Potential Binary Proxy Execution Via VSDiagnostics.EXE
// ID: ac1c92b4-ac81-405a-9978-4604d78cc47e
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-08-03
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1218
// Description: Detects execution of "VSDiagnostics.exe" with the "start" command in order to launch and proxy arbitrary binaries.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " /launch:") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " -launch:"))) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "start")) AND ((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\VSDiagnostics.exe")) OR (where(OriginalFileName = "VSDiagnostics.exe"))))
